      "source": "sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor RV as 검수자(REVIEWER)\n    participant SCC as SystemConfigController\n    participant SCS as SystemConfigService\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL (설정)\n    participant CA as Caffeine 캐시 (TTL 60s)\n    participant STS as Sam2TrackService\n\n    RV->>SCC: PUT /v1/manage/configs/POLYGON_SIMPLIFY_TOLERANCE (value)\n    alt WORKER 호출\n        SCC-->>RV: 403 (REVIEWER 전용)\n    else 값 범위 초과\n        SCC-->>RV: 400 (@Valid)\n    else 정상\n        SCC->>SCS: update(key, value, claims)\n        SCS->>DB: 설정값 저장\n        SCS->>CA: 캐시 전체 무효화\n        SCS-->>SCC: ConfigResponse\n        SCC-->>RV: 200 OK\n    end\n    Note over STS,CA: 이후 SAM2 track 시 적용\n    STS->>SCS: getDouble(POLYGON_SIMPLIFY_TOLERANCE)\n    SCS->>CA: 캐시 조회\n    alt 조회 실패\n        STS->>STS: 기본값 1.0px fail-safe\n    else 설정값\n        CA-->>STS: epsilon\n    end\n    STS->>STS: PolygonSimplifier.simplify(epsilon)",
